Privacy Policy for Wordet
Last Updated: 16/6/2026

1. Overview

Wordet (the "App") is designed with a "Privacy First" philosophy. We believe that your data belongs to you, and our App is built to ensure it stays that way.

2. No Data Collection

We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal information. * No Personal Data: We do not ask for or collect names, email addresses, or phone numbers.

No Tracking: We do not use cookies, tracking pixels, or any third-party analytics (like Google Analytics or Firebase).

No Device Data: We do not collect identifiers like IP addresses or IDFA.

3. Offline Functionality

The App operates 100% offline. All processing and data storage occur locally on your device. No data is ever sent to our servers or any third-party servers.

4. Third-Party Services

The App does not integrate with any third-party SDKs, social media plugins, or advertising networks that could collect your data.

5. Children's Privacy

Because we do not collect any data, our App is safe for users of all ages and complies with the Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA).

6. Changes to This Policy

We may update this policy from time to time. However, our commitment to "Zero Data Collection" will remain a core principle of the App.

7. Contact Us

If you have any questions, feel free to contact us.
